      <div class="step-code">canvas = [MASK] × 256</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="step-box">
    <div class="step-num">3</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <div class="step-title">Entropy-Bounded denoising (repeat 1–48×)</div>
      <div class="step-desc">At each step, the decoder predicts logits for every canvas position. The lowest-entropy (most confident) tokens are locked in; the rest are re-masked for the next step.</div>
      <div class="step-code">canvas = eb_denoise_step(canvas, kv, step)</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="step-box">
