<span class="cs-line hl-g">DiffusionGemma: <span class="num">1100</span>+ tok/s  <span class="cmt"># 4× faster</span></span>
<span class="cs-line">Gemma 4 (AR):   ~<span class="num">275</span>  tok/s  <span class="cmt"># memory-bandwidth bound</span></span>
